.TH VMBACKUPCTL 1 "August 2026" "vmbackupd 0.1.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vmbackupctl \- command line client for vmbackupd
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vmbackupctl
.RI [ options ]
.RI command
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vmbackupctl
is the local command line client for the
.B vmbackupd
daemon.

It is used to inspect daemon status and perform supported administrative
operations through the local vmbackupd control API.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vmbackupd (8),
.BR virsh (1)
